{"2085310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Emberbane", "steam_appid": 2085310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/2999d6fda31aa9fe9c3d9b5222c1e152.avif?t=1772023040\" width=640 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ash and hymn, crown and chain - Elsinore has kept both. Once a throne of pledge and bread, now a map of embers and graves. From that ruin you will rise. You are Ophelia: a lonely orphan, a borrowed king, and a promise that will never die. A warrior bound by fire, haunted by betrayal and yet unbroken by chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through haunted forests, drowned citadels, frozen palaces and forgotten deserts, you carve a path not only through steel and stone - but through memory, betrayal and weight of a dying world that does not wish to be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not just about survival but  what remains when the flames die.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/7b1b51fbc56b1dbd6400575eed054687.avif?t=1772023040\" width=640 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire, Ice, Earth and Storm:</strong>  Four forces shape the realm, twisting every battlefield, puzzle and secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/b250878ff443f5b37ad30e15df22979a.poster.avif?t=1772023040\" width=640 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/b250878ff443f5b37ad30e15df22979a.webm?t=1772023040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/b250878ff443f5b37ad30e15df22979a.mp4?t=1772023040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Octane Action:</strong> Chain different abilities to amplify your combat prowess and strike fear into the hearts of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/822dd2316517c99a1bb3016397f069a3.poster.avif?t=1772023040\" width=640 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/822dd2316517c99a1bb3016397f069a3.webm?t=1772023040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/822dd2316517c99a1bb3016397f069a3.mp4?t=1772023040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Unique Playstyle:</strong> Utilize the relics you discover throughout your journey to diversify your gameplay and carve out a combat style that is uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/5169eed52e728e95e29c231295d748a0.poster.avif?t=1772023040\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085310/extras/5169eed52e728e95e29c231295d748a0.webm?t=1772023040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat